WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Intake air bypass butterfly
What it does: Opens or closes a secondary intake passage.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Intake air bypass butterfly
How it works: The plate rotates inside the secondary passage.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Intake air bypass butterfly
How it moves: Changes position when the IAB operates; the demonstration opens and closes the mechanism, not once per 720° engine cycle.
